---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, CONTACT_EMAIL, EFFECTIVE_DATE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`Terms of Service — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description={`The terms governing your subscription to ${SITE_TITLE}.`}
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main class="wrap">
			<article class="prose">
				<h1>{SITE_TITLE} — Terms of Service</h1>
				<p class="updated">Effective date: {EFFECTIVE_DATE}</p>

				<p>
					<strong>Provider:</strong> RJR Trading Strategies LLC, a Maryland limited liability company
					trading as "The Weekend Dugout" ("Company," "we," "us"). By subscribing to or accessing The
					Weekend Dugout service (the "Service"), you ("Subscriber," "you") agree to these Terms of
					Service ("Terms").
				</p>

				<h2>1. The Service</h2>
				<p>
					The Service provides curated informational digests of publicly available regulatory filings
					(including filings made with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission via the EDGAR
					system) and aggregated news headlines with links to original sources, together with the
					Company's summaries, filters, and commentary. Delivery is by email and/or other channels
					described at checkout. Content, delivery frequency, coverage, and features may change as
					the Service evolves.
				</p>

				<h2>2. Informational Purposes Only — No Investment Advice</h2>
				<p>
					The Service is provided for informational and educational purposes only. Nothing in the
					Service constitutes, and should not be construed as, investment advice, a recommendation,
					an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any security or financial instrument, or legal,
					tax, or accounting advice. The Company is not a registered investment adviser,
					broker-dealer, or fiduciary to you, and no adviser-client relationship is created by your
					subscription. Summaries and commentary are descriptive characterizations of public
					information, not directives to act. You are solely responsible for your own investment
					decisions and should consult a licensed professional before making any financial decision.
				</p>

				<h2>3. Accuracy, Timeliness, and Sources</h2>
				<p>
					The Service aggregates and summarizes information from third-party and government sources.
					The Company does not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of any content.
					Filings may be delayed, amended, or withdrawn by their filers; news sources may correct or
					retract items; automated delivery may be interrupted. Original filings on EDGAR and
					original news articles at their source publications are the authoritative versions and
					always control over any summary provided by the Service.
				</p>

				<h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
				<p>
					The Company's curation, summaries, formatting, commentary, and compilations are the
					intellectual property of RJR Trading Strategies LLC. Underlying government filings are
					public information; linked news content remains the property of its respective publishers,
					and the Service links to — rather than reproduces — such content. Your subscription grants
					you a personal, non-transferable, non-exclusive license to use the Service for your own
					informational purposes. You may not redistribute, resell, republish, scrape, or
					systematically archive Service content, or share access credentials, without prior written
					permission.
				</p>

				<h2>5. Subscriptions, Billing, and Cancellation</h2>
				<p>
					Subscriptions are billed in advance on a recurring monthly basis through our payment
					processor (Stripe) at the price shown at checkout, plus any applicable sales tax. You may
					cancel at any time, effective at the end of the current billing period; access continues
					through the period already paid. Except where required by law, payments are non-refundable
					once a billing period begins; however, if the Service fails to deliver for five (5) or more
					consecutive days due to a fault within our control, you may request a pro-rata credit. We
					may change pricing with at least fourteen (14) days' notice before it takes effect on your
					next renewal.
				</p>

				<h2>6. Acceptable Use</h2>
				<p>
					You agree not to use the Service (a) for any unlawful purpose, including market
					manipulation or trading on material non-public information (the Service contains only
					public information, and you must not combine it with non-public information to violate
					securities laws); (b) to build a competing data product from Service content; or (c) in any
					manner that interferes with the operation of the Service.
				</p>

				<h2>7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
				<p class="caps">
					THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE," WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS
					OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, ACCURACY, OR
					UNINTERRUPTED AVAILABILITY.
				</p>

				<h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
				<p>
					<span class="caps"
						>TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, THE COMPANY'S TOTAL LIABILITY ARISING OUT OF OR
						RELATING TO THE SERVICE SHALL NOT EXCEED THE AMOUNTS YOU PAID FOR THE SERVICE IN THE
						THREE (3) MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM. THE COMPANY SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT,
						INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES, INCLUDING TRADING LOSSES, LOST PROFITS,
						OR LOST OPPORTUNITIES, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY.</span
					> Some jurisdictions do not allow certain limitations; in those jurisdictions, liability is
					limited to the fullest extent permitted.
				</p>

				<h2>9. Indemnification</h2>
				<p>
					You agree to indemnify and hold harmless the Company and its member, agents, and affiliates
					from claims arising out of your misuse of the Service or violation of these Terms.
				</p>

				<h2>10. Modifications; Termination</h2>
				<p>
					We may update these Terms with notice via the Service; continued use after the effective
					date constitutes acceptance. We may suspend or terminate access for violation of these
					Terms, with a pro-rata refund of any prepaid period if termination is not for cause.
				</p>

				<h2>11. Governing Law; Disputes</h2>
				<p>
					These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Maryland, without regard to
					conflict-of-laws principles. Disputes shall be resolved in the state or federal courts
					located in Maryland, and each party consents to their jurisdiction. In any action to
					enforce these Terms, the prevailing party is entitled to reasonable attorneys' fees.
				</p>

				<h2>12. Contact</h2>
				<p>
					RJR Trading Strategies LLC · 11907 Sun Valley Drive, Fort Washington, MD 20744 ·
					<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
				</p>
			</article>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.prose p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
	.caps {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--text);
	}
</style>
